  "id": "somatic-symptom-and-related-disorders",
  "term": "somatic symptom and related disorders",
  "definition": "Somatic symptom and related disorders are conditions in which a person has one or more physical symptoms along with excessive thoughts, feelings, or behaviors related to those symptoms. Common complaints include pain, fatigue, exhaustion, or problems involving body functions, and the symptoms are not adequately explained by usual medical disease or body abnormalities.",
